#: ../../tools/uscensus_tools.rst:32 d39691e95f8345daaec68b290292f3ce
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get population and demographic data from the US Census "
"Bureau API. Access decennial census and American Community Survey (ACS) "
"data at national, state, county, and city levels. No authentication key "
"required for basic usage. Variables include total population, housing "
"units, age groups, and race/ethnicity breakdowns. Useful for demographic "
"research, urban planning, and social science analysis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uscensus_tools.rst:34 b69f9c3b68c14b238c1ca8e7e537b9b9
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uscensus_tools.rst:36 9b47e4946f5443fc9342de319de7827a
msgid ""
"``get`` (string) (required) Comma-separated variable codes to retrieve "
"plus NAME. For 2020 decennial: 'P1\\_001N,NAME' (total pop). For ACS "
"5-year (B01003\\_001E=total pop, B19013\\_001E=median income, "
"B01002\\_001E=median age). Example: 'NAME,B01003\\_001E,B19013\\_001E'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uscensus_tools.rst:39 ce56ee69b03f4cb795a9d7b9f9e71093
msgid ""
"``for`` (string) (required) Geographic unit. Examples: 'state:\\*' (all "
"states), 'county:\\*' (all counties), 'state:06' (California), "
"'county:001&in=state:06' (Alameda County CA)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uscensus_tools.rst:42 68d161b1dcf74f6d810d556a61d83eae
msgid ""
"``dataset`` (string, null) (optional) Dataset to query. Values: "
"'2020/dec/pl' (2020 decennial), '2022/acs/acs5' (ACS 5-year 2022), "
"'2021/acs/acs1' (ACS 1-year 2021). Default: 2022/acs/acs5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uscensus_tools.rst:45 ce31908c3ae04929aa69527ff1d511d7
msgid ""
"``in`` (string, null) (optional) Geographic filter for sub-national "
"queries. Examples: 'state:06' (within California)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uscensus_tools.rst:48 22ffa04797d64364affe6947264018fc
msgid "``limit`` (integer, null) (optional) Maximum number of results to return"
msgstr ""

